WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.996
This short guide explains how one book becomes twenty eight ways to earn, and how to build each one.

00:00:07.146 --> 00:00:14.118
Here is the big idea. Your book is not the business. Your book is the hook that brings readers to you.

00:00:14.268 --> 00:00:20.064
To begin, click My Books Hub in the left menu, then click the book you want to work on.

00:00:20.214 --> 00:00:26.634
Your twenty eight revenue streams are grouped into three tabs: Brand, Build and Yield.

00:00:26.784 --> 00:00:34.668
Brand has nine streams that grow your audience, such as email marketing, a free lead magnet and your author website.

00:00:34.818 --> 00:00:42.390
This panel shows how many are built. Work from number one downwards, because each step supports the next.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:50.208
Build has nine streams that turn your book into products, like workbooks, home study courses and audiobooks.

00:00:50.358 --> 00:00:56.586
Yield has ten streams for bigger offers, such as speaking, coaching and certification.

00:00:56.736 --> 00:01:03.324
Each card is one revenue stream. It shows whether it is live, and how complete it is.

00:01:03.474 --> 00:01:08.934
Click Open and Manage to start building it, or to make changes later.

00:01:09.084 --> 00:01:14.520
Every stream is built in the same simple steps, shown along the top of the page.

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:22.146
First, read the introduction. Then ABBY, your AI assistant, writes a first draft using your book.

00:01:22.296 --> 00:01:30.588
Next, review the draft and change any words you like. Your edits are saved, and nothing is rewritten unless you ask.

00:01:30.738 --> 00:01:37.086
Finally, click Publish. The stream only goes live once everything it needs is ready.

00:01:37.236 --> 00:01:44.184
When it is live, its page appears on your author website, under your name and the correct book.

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:49.026
You can see everything in one place on the Review and Publish tab.

00:01:49.176 --> 00:01:55.524
That's it. Open your book, pick a stream, review ABBY's draft, then publish.

00:01:55.674 --> 00:01:59.334
Authors Bureau. Your Story is Your LIFE.
